        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anachronismaxe/{size}/2163_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-19T22:38:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><em>If you are an animator of any kind, I would love to see the idea described here in motion!</em></p><p>First off, if you're not familiar with \"I'll Make a Man Out of You\" from Mulan, you can watch it here:&nbsp;<br><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSS5dEeMX64\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSS5dEeMX64</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now then. I was watching Mulan last night, and this song came into my head just now. I got this image of Tachyon running to the line of \"You must be swift as a coursing river\", and I had this amazing idea: a music video of Ra becoming Horus in a slightly differently-worded version of this song. I know he goes into the desert alone and comes back as Horus, but... this is something I'd love to see.</p><p>Picture Tachyon doing running exercises with Ra...</p><p>Tempest blasting him with typhoons...</p><p>Absolute Zero creating hoarfires while Ra creates a flaming tornado and blasting Legacy, who shrugs it off...</p><p>The Wraith and Mister Fixer showing him some of their techniques on a moonlit night...</p><p>Picture The Argent Adept playing his instruments in the background...</p><p>Picture \"the huns\" being the Ennead...</p><p>Picture Legacy asking for \"suns\", and Young Legacy and Expatriette showing up instead...</p><p>Picture Ra slowly growing out his beard...</p><p>I think this should be a thing, and if I was an animator, I would totally do it! If anyone on this forum is an animator, it would be amazing if they could give it a shot... With &gt;G's permission, of course! What does everyone here think?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:44.223Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
