        "raw": "<p><em>If you are an animator of any kind, I would love to see the idea described here in motion!</em></p><p>First off, if you&#39;re not familiar with &quot;I&#39;ll Make a Man Out of You&quot; from Mulan, you can watch it here:&nbsp;<br /><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSS5dEeMX64\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZSS5dEeMX64</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now then. I was watching Mulan last night, and this song came into my head just now. I got this image of Tachyon running to the line of &quot;You must be swift as a coursing river&quot;, and I had this amazing idea: a music video of Ra becoming Horus in a slightly differently-worded version of this song. I know he goes into the desert alone and comes back as Horus, but... this is something I&#39;d love to see.</p><p>Picture Tachyon doing running exercises with Ra...</p><p>Tempest blasting him with typhoons...</p><p>Absolute Zero creating hoarfires while Ra creates a flaming tornado and blasting Legacy, who shrugs it off...</p><p>The Wraith and Mister Fixer showing him some of their techniques on a moonlit night...</p><p>Picture The Argent Adept playing his instruments in the background...</p><p>Picture &quot;the huns&quot; being the Ennead...</p><p>Picture Legacy asking for &quot;suns&quot;, and Young Legacy and Expatriette showing up instead...</p><p>Picture Ra slowly growing out his beard...</p><p>I think this should be a thing, and if I was an animator, I would totally do it! If anyone on this forum is an animator, it would be amazing if they could give it a shot... With &gt;G&#39;s permission, of course! What does everyone here think?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
