        "created_at": "2012-11-20T21:19:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Remix_culture\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Remix_culture</a></p><p>It basically means making fan works based off of Sentinels, be it original animation, \"radio play\" style works, fanfiction,&nbsp;music, fan-made games, etcetera.</p><p>Basically, being a dedicated fan and utilizing your talents to exemplify the thing you love.&nbsp; In this case, Sentinels of the Multiverse.</p>",
