        "created_at": "2012-11-20T22:46:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ahh…like my making quizzes about it, you mean? Well, alright, that's not <span class=\"bbcode-i\">particularly</span> creative…but I do have a creative idea in mind for something Sentinels-related I want to do. I just won't be able to do it for a while, that's all.</p>\n<p>But if the chance to do anything writing-related comes up, I'm interested - I like words :).</p>",
